auth.description:
Lowercase hex HMAC-SHA256 with the shared link secret, present when the link is authenticated. Signed text: "fakenet-link-v1 event
{request_id}
{session_id}
{payload}" (payload exactly as sent, base64).

Lowercase hex HMAC-SHA256 with the shared link secret, present when the link is authenticated. Signed text: "fakenet-link-v1 action
{request_id}
{session_id}
{response base64, or -}
{close}
{delay_ms, or -}". The nucleus rejects unsigned or forged actions when it has a secret.
